# rocKE-AOT kernel binaries are churning build products compiled at build time by each
# family's producer (see ../README.md §9). They are NEVER vendored into git; the build
# emits them into ${AOT_CATALOG_BUILD_DIR} and TheRock packages them from there.
#
# (A future prebuilt-.co / AITER-ASM family that DOES check in its .co would add a
#  per-family negation, e.g. `!gfx942/fmha_v3_fwd/*.co`, or force-add with `git add -f`.)
*.co
*.hsaco
